            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.1.17+2PE.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet. 1.17-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enyuma we chindaalo sita Yesu abukula Petero, Yakobo ne wandaaye Yohona, abayila khu sikulu sileeyi babaayo bong'ene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga yaba ne baloleleele lukoondo lwa Yesu lwakaluukhana, mumoni mwewe mwakhosia nga enyanga, lundi chingubo chewe chawangia cherereere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babeeka chana babona Musa ne Elicha ne balomaloma ne Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Petero asuta kumunwa aboolela Yesu ali, “Omwami buli bulayi efwe khuba ano, nosiima, lekha nombakhe ano kamaeema kataru, lilala liliowo, liliindi lia Musa ne liliindi lia Elicha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
