              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero abakobosia ali, “Yee.” Nga Petero engila munju, Yesu anyoa aalomaloma naye, amureeba ali, “Wibaasia siina, Simoni? Babaami be sibala baroosia busuuru khukhwama khu naanu? Khukhwama khu baana be sibala siabwe namwe khu bakeni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero akobosia ali, “Khukhwama khu bakeni.” Yesu amuboolela ali, “Nono kaaba kario aba babaandu be sibala esio bali balekhuule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali khulekha khubaambia lirima, cha khu nyanja mala omwaatemo kumulobo, olobe eng'eeni enyoa khukhwicha khu mulobo, wasamie kumunwa kwayo, kene onyoolemo chirupia chicholaana khuruunga busuuru bwe Lukaangu. Bukula ching'enecho obaelesie nga busuuru bwase ne bubwowo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
